ble=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"padding: 0px 50px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 1px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; position: relative; display: inline-block; width: calc(100% - 6px); overflow: hidden; background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; width: auto; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\">1.前言</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"></span></p></div></span></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; 首先需要说明的是，这是简单的概率统计学问题，需要一定的高中数学基础，如果不清楚可以直接参照结论，如果有异议，请在数学层面提出质疑，请不要用<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">短时间，少数个体</span>的数据样本，来进行玄学解释或者反驳，否则就是你说的都对。【ps：除非策划暗改概率，但是这一定可以被氪佬检测出来，因此可能性不大】</div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"padding: 0px 50px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 1px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; position: relative; display: inline-block; width: calc(100% - 6px); overflow: hidden; background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; width: auto; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\">2.还魂种类</span></p></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612767115879_32072972.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612767115879_32072972.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp; 另外还有鬼魂和满魂，在点火版本<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">性价比非常低，</span>正常人请不要碰这后面两个</div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612767958274_1454364.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612767958274_1454364.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"padding: 0px 50px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 1px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; position: relative; display: inline-block; width: calc(100% - 6px); overflow: hidden; background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; width: auto; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\">3.还魂概率说明</span></p></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp; 首先说明，因为四星和玛瑙在国际服获取相对血石比较容易，所以此处只计算消耗的血石成本</div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">不考虑双倍还魂的情况下<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">可知12血石＝10%概率【一次保底条】<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">且120血石＝100/概率【不涨保底条】<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">又因为保底条满为32次，满后给五星<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">所以:<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">①当100％抽，120血石＝一次五星<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">②当10％抽时，若一直抽不中，需要32次*12血石＝384血石＝一个五星<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">那么，10%抽32次，中途需要出几次，血石成本才能和100％抽持平呢？<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">明显由上可知，需要中途抽中两次，加上保底的一次，384/3＝128血石<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">所以也就是说，当10％抽32次，抽出两个以下亏损，两个不亏不赚，两个以上就赚到</span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">那么，血赚和血亏的几率是多少？</span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">需要用到独立重复实验:</span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612770381907_95508006.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612770381907_95508006.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">血亏概率：零个五星+一个五星</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612770634914_56096172.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612770634914_56096172.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div></span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div></span>不赚不亏概率:两个五星</span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612770749626_44751333.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612770749626_44751333.png\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">血赚概率概率:两个五星以上</span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\">1-15.6%-21%=63.4%</span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"padding: 0px 50px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 1px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; position: relative; display: inline-block; width: calc(100% - 6px); overflow: hidden; background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; line-height: 1.8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; width: auto; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\">4.结论</span></p></div></span><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\">用10%抽，在没有双倍还魂的情况下，<span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">血亏几率是15.6%，不赚不亏几率是21%，血赚几率是63.4%</span></span></div><div style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; li